{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"effc138d2c9f173ebcaac6a7d6725ccb0b91246814268910110949764a87e9eb","ja":"チャレンジ、ゲーム実況！","zh":"挑战游戏实况！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ef595c24c65e727597cf581c754ad51237736a319c7fd707f7389caa878b3aca","ja":"みなさん、こんにちは！　3回に分けてお送りする番組\n『劇場ゲーム部』、記念すべき第1回目の放送です！","zh":"大家，下午好！分3期为您带来的节目\n“剧场游戏部”，迎来了值得纪念的第1期播出！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"df83be85e46b116253b8cfa7529fde7787a0daa01bc6b771d31de21d34fb737c","ja":"この番組では、私たちがいろんなゲームを\n実際にプレイする様子を生放送するんですよ！","zh":"在这个节目里，我们会把大家\n实际玩各种游戏时的样子直播出去哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0453af7775880ae571f30573ecd9de469a9cf193684d8ae2d0b6b0263238e37f","ja":"今回、私たちがプレイするのは～～～\nホラーゲーム『ソードハザード』です！","zh":"这次我们要玩的是～～～\n恐怖游戏《剑刃危机》！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"672ede008bd85b282fc802d01d798c9690995a7ca44da9e9e213b1e00510ec9b","ja":"それじゃあさっそくいってみましょう！\nゲームスタート！","zh":"那么事不宜迟，让我们开始吧！\n游戏开始！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a2d3ca1d8f45e6fa2e27e9050c1eb266367bfdca1118858b65939a4d03d5065c","ja":"うう……すっごくリアルなお家ですね……。\nゾンビはどこから出てくるんでしょう……。","zh":"呜呜……好逼真的房子啊……\n僵尸会从哪里冒出来呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"aa92a74150b89e51c276e2da900e522bba150cf96f18f05c4a4113c80933649a","ja":"わ、私もこのゲームは初めてで\nわからなくて……。","zh":"我、我也是第一次玩这个游戏，\n不太懂……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"adfa407bc999d12a0d25501ddbfc51ec6fb4e3fe81c1257498213341c6f25d05","ja":"すっごくリアルで怖いって評判は\n聞いてたんですけど……。","zh":"虽然听说过特别逼真又吓人的评价……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d0d42e47b0de414ae161e15ab208000e155c4d7effdb9bd0780fe04f7962745e","ja":"イメージしてた以上ですね……。\nちょ、ちょっとダメかも……！","zh":"超出了想象呢……\n有、有点吃不消了……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d53e3c71437fbdc565aa33055e7146455ef333cbb9d22c32d790a4cd5d93b639","ja":"ううう……怖いよ～……。\nは、早く終わらせちゃいましょ～……。","zh":"呜呜呜……好害怕啊～……\n还、还是快点结束吧～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"b99ddff2d1b872536e2f9b8ad2a679e94857f62bf1854aef0f17282d4d59e10b","ja":"あれっ？　あそこになにか落ちてますよ。\nもったいないから拾っちゃいますね！","zh":"哎呀？那里好像掉了什么东西。\n放着不管太可惜了，我这就去捡起来！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"938a38e5e46c28874f59fcb64d2b96150b4dcfc499d8623101996f9261aebf14","ja":"あっ、やよいさん！\nそれはなんか危険な香りが！　止めた方が……。","zh":"啊，弥生！\n感觉那隐约散发着危险的气息！还是停下来比较好……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f053487da415b741897c8f2d0341e867532098f94e40e8180b989d211ab1476d","ja":"ギシャアアアアアッ！！！","zh":"嘎嘶啊啊啊啊啊！！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"50943a6e8c10c7b331cb7d07d234ed0e5e4724b838a5e2871f8b2dcfaab7553f","ja":"いやああああああっ！？\n出た～～～！？　血、血が……！","zh":"呀啊啊啊啊啊——！？\n出来了～～～！？血、流血了……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"2603a586f042ee8075d833d7315df430a6cb2959f5c48566452e8f4bc75dffb0","ja":"はわわわ～～～っ！？\nど、ど、どうしたらいいんですか～！？","zh":"哇哇哇哇～～～！？\n到、到、到底该怎么办才好啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"6b63d0956e4935e5919e2081afc3b5886f09c9b4da078a75e8fdff77ce6de5ce","ja":"逃げましょう！　まだ剣もないですし！\n全速力で逃げて、まずは武器を探さないと……。","zh":"快逃吧！现在连剑都没有呢！\n得全速逃跑，先去找武器才行……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"d47fe4b770dc5167a9e7400e3973afcb9cfdee4a45dc2bf4d436bef3e7bb75c2","ja":"わ、分かりました～～～っ！","zh":"我、我知道了～～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"1346cad91d46f925f2706aaa6fac4191c4cd2c3385802b1b8db2a657651de3b3","ja":"……あれ！？　あそこにもなにか落ちてます！","zh":"……咦！？那里好像也掉了什么东西！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"e322291ff7cc031658de74fafeb2bffbde35cd7b3b4552dfea40af03f50343dd","ja":"そ、それは後でいいですから！\nとにかく逃げないと……。","zh":"那、那个之后再说啦！\n总之得先逃跑……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1017.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"167cbc8ba3fd52e08bf596324895bcf8fb9a67e49125ccc008e8af76dfff33ea","ja":"きゃああああああっ！\nこっちにもゾンビが～～！！！","zh":"啊啊啊啊啊啊——！\n这边也有僵尸啊～～！！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
